    (3, '2025-09-17 09:23:04.072738+00', 2, 'Film Allusions in "The Simpsons"', NULL, 'Few TV series have been as richly layered with allusions to contemporary and classic films as "The Simpsons." From blink-and-you''ll-miss-it sight gags to clever dialogue puns to meticulous recreations of entire scenes, the show boasts enough movie references to hold any film lover''s interest.', '{}', 'Theme');
